# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

Integration resource for representing external API/service dependencies. Use this to document external services your project depends on (REST APIs, GraphQL APIs, SaaS platforms, etc.) with structured documentation references, environment URLs, SDK information, and example code.

## Example Usage

```hcl
# Basic REST API integration
resource "tofukit_integration" "open_meteo" {
  name        = "open-meteo"
  type        = "rest_api"
  description = "Open-Meteo Weather API"
  version     = "v1"

  docs = {
    main        = "https://open-meteo.com/en/docs"
    rate_limits = "https://open-meteo.com/en/features#rate-limits"
  }

  environments = {
    production = "https://api.open-meteo.com/v1"
  }
}

# GraphQL API with SDK info
resource "tofukit_integration" "github" {
  name = "github-graphql"
  type = "graphql_api"

  sdk = {
    python = {
      package  = "gql"
      version  = "3.4.0"
      docs_url = "https://gql.readthedocs.io/"
    }
  }
}
```

{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Integration Types

- **`rest_api`** - RESTful HTTP APIs
- **`graphql_api`** - GraphQL APIs
- **`grpc_api`** - gRPC services
- **`webhook`** - Webhook integrations
- **`websocket`** - WebSocket connections
- **`saas`** - SaaS platform APIs (Stripe, Twilio, etc.)
- **`cloud_service`** - Cloud provider services

## Common Patterns

### Documentation URLs (`docs`)
```hcl
docs = {
  main           = "https://api.example.com/docs"
  authentication = "https://api.example.com/auth"
  rate_limits    = "https://api.example.com/limits"
}
```

### Environment URLs (`environments`)
```hcl
environments = {
  production = "https://api.example.com"
  sandbox    = "https://sandbox-api.example.com"
}
```

### SDK Information (`sdk`)
```hcl
sdk = {
  python = {
    package  = "example-sdk"
    version  = "1.0.0"
    docs_url = "https://example-sdk.readthedocs.io"
  }
}
```

## Cross-Referencing

```hcl
resource "tofukit_project" "app" {
  requirements = [{
    name = "Integration"
    instructions = [{
      prompt = "Use ${tofukit_integration.stripe.link} for payments"
    }]
  }]
}
```

